              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "First earnings per share: EPS = net income \u00f7 diluted shares = 167.4 \u00f7 103.7 = $1.61. Then price = EPS \u00d7 target P/E = 1.61 \u00d7 15.0 = $24.22 (the 15\u00d7 is a stated ASSUMPTION standing in for a peer set).",
